      "side": 1,
      "message": "Perhaps we should indicate the usage of the `-x` option. IMO this currently suggests to manually enter this information. Something like:\n```\n- when cherry-picking, use the `-x` option to record the original commit information.\n- if applicable, prefer to cherry-pick the commit from the corresponding stable branch.\n```\n\nWhat do others thing of this though?",
